OL,3,ASeventh man bailed in connection with
OL,4,ARAF Fairford incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 22-year-old British national who was
OL,7,Farrested on suspicion of preparing acts
OL,8,Fof terror in connection with an
OL,9,Fincident close to RAF Fairford has been
OL,10,Freleased on bail.
OL,12,FThe man was arrested in Westminster,
OL,13,FLondon, under Section 5 of the
OL,14,FTerrorism Act 2006 on Tuesday, as part
OL,15,Fof the counter-terror police
OL,16,Finvestigation into the incident near
OL,17,Fthe airbase in Gloucestershire.
OL,19,FIn total, seven men - all in their 20s
OL,20,F- have been arrested and later bailed
OL,21,Fin connection with the incident. No one
OL,22,Fhas been charged.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
