OL,3,ASeventh man bailed in connection with
OL,4,ARAF Fairford incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major incident was declared and
OL,7,Fdozens of homes were evacuated after
OL,8,Fpolice were alerted to three suspicious
OL,9,Fvehicles near the airbase in the early
OL,10,Fhours of 27 September.
